ies:*\n- Position 2: Animation\n- Position 1: Must be the other genre -> **Thriller**\n\n*Nationalities:*\n- Position 2: Pakistani\n- Position 1: Must be the other nationality -> **Nigerian**\n\n**Final Configuration:**\n- **Position 1**: Job = Videographer, Movie = Thriller, Nationality = Nigerian\n- **Position 2**: Job = Freelancer, Movie = Animation, Nationality = Pakistani\n\n**4. Answer the Specific Questions**\n\n1.  **What is the job of the person who is pakistani?**\n    The Pakistani person is in Position 2. Their job is **freelancer**.\n\n2.  **What is the movie genre of the person who is pakistani?**\n    The Pakistani person is in Position 2. Their movie genre is **animation**.\n\n3.  **What movie genre does the person in position 1 watch?**\n    Position 1 watches **thriller**.\n\n4.  **At what position is the person who is a videographer?**\n    The videographer is in Position **1**.\n\n**Summary of Answers:**\n1. freelancer\n2. animation\n3. thriller\n4. 1\n\n<solution>freelancer, animation, thriller, 1</solution>\n\nFinal answer: freelancer, animation, thriller, 1", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.0066009588}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " break", "logprob": -0.039522115}, {"token": " down", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " logic", "logprob": -0.042670414}, {"token": " step", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " by", "logprob": -6.3181124e-06}, {"token": " step", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -2.2746303}, {"token": " determine", "logprob": -0.028839428}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " attributes", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " for", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " each", "logprob": -0.00062646216}, {"token": " person", "logprob": -0.023276437}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.39885265}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -2.264979e-06}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.043199588}, {"token": ".", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Setup", "logprob": -0.06274119}